WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:05.120
Return to your rest, my soul,
for the Lord has been good

2
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.230
to you.

3
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:10.580
That's what I hope you saw today
in this time of journaling: is

4
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:13.680
that the Lord has
been good to you.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.170
Even in those spaces, in those
places where maybe you didn't

6
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.250
realize it, maybe you didn't see
it, maybe you didn't even want

7
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.930
to acknowledge it.

8
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.190
Or maybe

9
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.830
you were just facing something
super difficult in your life.

10
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.890
And you were crying out
to God, where are you?

11
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.280
And today you realized

12
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.040
he was right there.

13
00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.080
He was there because he loves you.

14
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.440
And he's calling your
soul to return to rest.

15
00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:44.360
Thank you for joining me today
for this spiritual workout.

16
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:48.520
If I can pray for you,
please send me a prayer request.

17
00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:52.280
If you haven't sent one before,
when this ends, it's gonna swipe

18
00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.600
up to the next screen where
you can complete the workout.

19
00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.880
You can rate the workout.

20
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.720
Of course, feel free to do that.

21
00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.800
But you can also submit
a prayer request.

22
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:03.080
If I can pray for you in any way,
do not hesitate to send that

23
00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.140
to me. I look
forward to seeing you

24
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.760
on our next workout together.
Let me close our time.

25
00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:10.740
Lord.

26
00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:13.170
Oh god, you're so good.

27
00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:14.820
You're the God of mercy.

28
00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.020
You're the God of grace.

29
00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:17.490
You're the God of love.

30
00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.370
Lord, you speak to us.

31
00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:24.500
And Lord, sometimes
we don't even see it.

32
00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:27.380
And we're tracing our life back
and thinking about moments where

33
00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:31.460
you've shown incredible grace to
us and just realizing that part

34
00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:36.850
of that is giving our soul freedom

35
00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:41.140
to rest. And so, Lord,
that's what we want to do today.

36
00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:45.780
We want to return to our rest
because you have been good

37
00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:48.567
to us. In Jesus' name, amen.

